sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    box PUBLIC ZONE
        participant RS as Routing Service<br>trade-imports-<br>routing-proxy
        participant JF as Journey Frontend<br>trade-imports-<br>{journey}-frontend
        participant FD as Front Door<br>trade-imports-<br>ins-frontend
    end
    box PROTECTED ZONE
        participant SS as Session Service
    end
    participant IDM as IDM

    B->>RS: POST /auth/switch<br>anti-forgery token,<br>session cookie
    RS->>FD: POST /auth/switch<br>anti-forgery token,<br>session cookie
    Note over FD: Sealed cookie value read<br>from the cookie
    FD->>SS: GET /sessions/assertion<br>Ins-Session-Token, Sec-Fetch-*,<br>Ins-Browser-Accept
    Note over SS: lastSeenAt written,<br>no refresh
    SS-->>FD: 200 csrfSecret
    Note over FD: Anti-forgery token checked
    FD->>SS: POST /sign-ins<br>mode switch,<br>sealed cookie value
    Note over SS: Round trip stored<br>with sessionId
    SS-->>FD: 201 Created<br>IDM address, binding value
    FD-->>B: 302 Location: IDM authorize endpoint<br>Set-Cookie: binding cookie
    B->>IDM: GET IDM authorize endpoint<br>?client_id, redirect_uri,<br>scope=openid {serviceId} offline_access,<br>state, nonce, code_challenge,<br>forceReselection=true
    Note over B,IDM: Government Gateway session still live, not asked for credentials
    IDM-->>B: 200 organisation picker
    B->>IDM: Picks Riverside Imports Ltd
    IDM-->>B: 302 Location: /auth/callback<br>?code=…&state=…
    B->>RS: GET /auth/callback?code=…&state=…<br>session and binding cookies
    RS->>FD: GET /auth/callback?code=…&state=…<br>session and binding cookies
    FD->>SS: POST /sign-ins/{state}/completion<br>code, binding value,<br>sealed cookie value
    Note over SS: Round trip consumed,<br>binding value<br>and session checked
    SS->>IDM: POST IDM token endpoint<br>grant_type=authorization_code,<br>via CDP's outbound proxy
    IDM-->>SS: 200 tokens for<br>the new organisation
    Note over SS: ID token checked,<br>roles filtered
    Note over SS: Record updated in place,<br>lastSeenAt written
    SS-->>FD: 204 switch complete
    Note over FD: Session cookie unchanged
    FD-->>B: 302 Location: / (dashboard)<br>binding cookie cleared
    Note over B,JF: Later, John submits the Northgate form
    B->>RS: POST /gbn-ag/notifications/123/commodity-lines<br>second tab, Northgate anti-forgery token
    RS->>JF: POST /notifications/123/commodity-lines<br>session cookie
    Note over JF: Sealed cookie value read<br>from the cookie
    Note over JF: Anti-forgery check fails,<br>csrfSecret replaced
